                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The United States Deputy
                            Marshal to the United States
                        Marshal.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">El
                                Paso, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 26,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Inclosed please find copy of a
                    communication I received today. * * *</p>
                <p>Yours, very truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. R. Hillebrand.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
